      "side": 1,
      "message": "One other thing I forgot to ask: is FutureHandle roughly equivalent to a shared_ptr\u003cGLuint\u003e? Could we use that instead? I realize that would remove the mIsSet check, but I don\u0027t see great value in that TBH.",
